WEBVTT

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:44.560
Mikono...

00:00:54.970 --> 00:00:57.040
The circle of life turns.

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:59.280
Our souls are born over and over.

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:02.660
They experience grief over and over.

00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:06.330
And that grief goes to the arms of God in Heaven.

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:07.290
This is...

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:10.420
That is the beautiful law of the world.

00:01:11.010 --> 00:01:18.180
Unfortunately, his soul has left the realm of law for something higher.

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:25.310
For we do not have the last son's body.

00:01:26.290 --> 00:01:32.310
I say to you that Altair must not die

00:01:32.310 --> 00:01:35.160
without seeing even a glimpse of its future.

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:38.340
We have nothing to fear.

00:01:39.290 --> 00:01:42.500
The last son has shown us the way.

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:48.420
He has shown us that we live in a time of miracles!

00:01:52.310 --> 00:01:53.960
That's ridiculous.

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:58.000
Altair has no future. Its days are numbered.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:02.560
And Ianthe's power is becoming unstable.

00:02:03.090 --> 00:02:06.560
You can't keep them in the dark forever.

00:02:07.590 --> 00:02:09.810
Mikage! What do you think you're doing?

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:13.720
Just spreading the great news to the flock.

00:02:13.720 --> 00:02:17.490
You sacrificed Jin for this?

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:21.200
He gave much to the world of Altair.

00:02:22.090 --> 00:02:25.830
His life was a fair price to pay.

00:02:26.210 --> 00:02:27.480
What do you mean?

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:30.600
We were able to deal a great blow to the Rare Iguras' nest.

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:33.340
We obtained a great deal of direct data on the true Eve candidates.

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:40.590
And the reborn Wings of the Sun finally revealed itself.

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:48.980
Jin's soul would be filled with joy if he knew what he brought us.

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:57.260
Perhaps it will be reborn with the first of Altair's new generation.

00:03:02.690 --> 00:03:05.620
So that's what you really wanted.

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:13.780
Jin, what I... what Altair has done can never be forgiven.

00:03:25.950 --> 00:03:29.060
We'll be taking them to the graveyard in Neo-Stanley.

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:32.060
The boat will arrive at 2:00. I want everyone there.

00:03:32.630 --> 00:03:34.320
Or turn visible.

00:03:34.830 --> 00:03:36.180
Oh...

00:03:36.180 --> 00:03:39.570
Is she going to shut herself in forever?

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:42.680
I know how she feels, though.

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:46.020
If I lost someone I loved, I'd...

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:55.960
Yunoha...

00:03:56.850 --> 00:03:58.840
Mikono Suzushiro.

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:01.620
High Commander Fudo?

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:08.300
I don't like him at all...

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:10.840
Bring Yunoha Thrul out of her room.

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:14.600
I want to leave her alone for now.

00:04:15.050 --> 00:04:19.940
This school's duty is to foster Union, a positive bond that connects people together.

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:23.580
None can be allowed to selfishly drown alone in their own sorrow.

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:25.570
How can you call that selfish?

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:30.450
Have you forgotten Yunoha's Element power? The power to disappear.

00:04:31.050 --> 00:04:37.520
In the wake of Jin Musou's death, her power may go out of control...

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:38.820
and she could erase herself.

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:49.360
You haven't changed.

00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:09.280
Yunoha, may I come in?

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:11.340
Mikono...

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:21.480
I thought you might want something to drink.

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:24.360
I'm sorry.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:26.880
You don't have to if you don't want to.

00:05:27.770 --> 00:05:29.510
I'll just leave it here.

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:34.090
Yunoha's aura is getting fainter.

00:05:34.090 --> 00:05:36.270
But what can I possibly say?

00:05:38.330 --> 00:05:40.500
Jin asked me...

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:44.800
He asked me to go with him.

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:51.140
If only I'd gone, Jin wouldn't...

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:56.330
Oh, no... It's getting even fainter now...

00:05:56.670 --> 00:05:57.960
She's really going to disappear.

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:04.760
Come, Yunoha.

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:08.460
Come with us.

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:11.660
I can't! I don't want to!

00:06:13.090 --> 00:06:17.680
I don't want to... to say goodbye to Jin!

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:21.240
Then don't say goodbye.

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:27.490
I don't want to say goodbye to you, or to Jin either!

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:31.000
I love you, Yunoha. You're a precious friend to me.

00:06:31.690 --> 00:06:33.740
Please...

00:06:45.790 --> 00:06:46.640
Jin...

00:06:58.210 --> 00:07:02.580
Mother, you're on Jin's world?

00:07:06.850 --> 00:07:09.160
I... want to...

00:07:27.970 --> 00:07:29.560
At last.

00:07:30.530 --> 00:07:36.520
At last, the students are learning how grateful they
should be to the place we risk our lives to protect,

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:40.860
and to the classmates we've lost.

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:43.960
What the hell?! We're talking about peoples' lives-

00:07:50.430 --> 00:07:51.280
I'm sorry.

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:56.220
Are you...

00:07:56.220 --> 00:07:57.500
Sorry.

00:07:57.500 --> 00:08:00.750
We've decided to quit school and go back home.

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:03.580
So you're giving up and running away?!

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:08.840
We Elements have been chosen to fight for this planet!

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:11.470
How could you forget what an honor that-

00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:13.470
Mix, stop.

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:15.840
How can you stand this?!

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:18.940
We've been through so much training and...

00:08:19.740 --> 00:08:21.730
Andy, don't tell me...

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:26.500
I'm staying.

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:30.860
Someone has to stick around or we're all doomed.

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:35.540
We'll all be sucked into that big hole in the sky.

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:39.440
I'm not gonna fall into someone else's hole.

00:08:39.440 --> 00:08:41.000
I won't let it happen.

00:08:41.770 --> 00:08:42.920
Andy...

00:09:28.810 --> 00:09:30.460
Andy W. Hol.

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:32.960
Start digging.

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:44.850
This is a nightmare!

00:09:45.470 --> 00:09:48.000
All these holes...

00:09:49.550 --> 00:09:51.610
Thank you, Andy.

00:09:54.060 --> 00:09:56.640
What are these holes for?

00:09:57.400 --> 00:09:58.910
The planet Altair...

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:07.080
Jin Musou came from another planet called Altair.

00:10:07.450 --> 00:10:08.330
Altair...

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:14.340
From the data Jin left us, we have ascertained Altair's intentions.

00:10:14.870 --> 00:10:18.840
They are kidnapping female Elements.

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:26.880
The war with Altair will only become more intense.

00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:31.360
As it goes on, more may find themselves buried beneath this earth.

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:35.370
In order to prepare you for the challenge of this war,

00:10:35.370 --> 00:10:37.490
you will be buried!

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:39.740
We'll be buried? Are you serious?

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:41.360
I name it...

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:43.740
Special Training of the Grave!

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:58.900
But why? We just buried our classmates!

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:01.640
I wouldn't want to be buried in any hole!

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:03.740
Let alone a grave!

00:11:03.740 --> 00:11:04.390
Hey...

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:07.040
Commander, isn't this...

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:08.390
This is terrible!

00:11:08.390 --> 00:11:10.060
Mikono!

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:13.800
How can you say such things when we're all still grieving?!

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:20.820
You are all bound by your lives.

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:27.330
As you sleep with the dead, your life force will grow.

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:33.000
Attachment, wickedness, love, stubbornness, and hatred.

00:11:33.510 --> 00:11:41.840
These thoughts form the links of a chain that shackles each of your souls.

00:11:43.210 --> 00:11:46.600
Here, just once, you must experience death.

00:11:50.550 --> 00:11:51.600
Death?

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:56.820
You will journey to the very edge of life, then return.

00:11:57.490 --> 00:12:00.680
What will you discover in your temporary death?

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:03.700
You must find out for yourselves!

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:06.700
This sounds fascinating.

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:07.860
Shrade!

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:11.860
I'm already on my way there myself.

00:12:12.430 --> 00:12:17.250
If my death is soon to come, I may as well rehearse.

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:20.500
Wait, Shrade!

00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:21.880
Yunoha!

00:12:22.650 --> 00:12:24.890
I want to be with him.

00:12:25.790 --> 00:12:29.180
I want to be with Jin, just for a little while.

00:12:33.510 --> 00:12:38.240
This is a deep hole. I'll have to fill it myself.

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:45.220
Filling a hole I worked so hard on feels like dying anyway.

00:12:49.650 --> 00:12:51.700
I'll never do it!

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:53.960
That's fine.

00:12:55.430 --> 00:12:57.960
Your eye looks like it can see through everything.

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:00.710
I hate it!

00:13:02.730 --> 00:13:04.970
That's also fine.

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:06.660
Mikono...

00:13:07.270 --> 00:13:08.510
Amata!

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:29.870
It's dark. I can't see a thing.

00:13:30.650 --> 00:13:34.500
This silence... There's no sound at all.

00:13:35.070 --> 00:13:36.200
Wrong.

00:13:36.200 --> 00:13:37.660
There is sound here.

00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:39.750
The sound of the bugs crawling through the earth.

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:45.880
The creatures that squirm through the dirt.

00:13:46.230 --> 00:13:50.500
I can feel the worms crawling over me, trying to get me...

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:53.380
I'm going to... I'm going to...

00:13:53.380 --> 00:13:56.700
I'm going to turn into dust and break apart...

00:13:58.390 --> 00:14:01.620
My body is rotting away...

00:14:03.350 --> 00:14:07.550
Rot away... and return to the earth...

00:14:07.550 --> 00:14:11.240
Where I'll be one with Jin again...

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:14.940
I'm so scared... I'm going to go back to the earth...

00:14:14.940 --> 00:14:17.780
At this rate, I'll never see the surface again...

00:14:17.780 --> 00:14:19.220
Don't be afraid!

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:21.410
I am afraid!

00:14:21.410 --> 00:14:23.740
Don't be afraid of this hole!

00:14:23.740 --> 00:14:25.120
I can't!

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:32.660
I can't do it.

00:14:32.660 --> 00:14:33.810
This is impossible!

00:14:34.230 --> 00:14:35.440
High Commander!

00:14:35.440 --> 00:14:36.660
This is too much!

00:14:36.660 --> 00:14:37.680
Silence!

00:14:39.650 --> 00:14:46.570
Well, well. The little Wingless are struggling in the darkness.

00:14:47.270 --> 00:14:51.620
You want to join them, don't you, Kagura?

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:54.080
To take the same journey to Hades?

00:14:57.570 --> 00:15:01.710
Rest in peace, Kagura...

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:06.320
Rest in peace.

00:15:10.350 --> 00:15:13.400
No matter how hard it gets, I can't leave!

00:15:14.070 --> 00:15:17.880
Andy dug this hole.

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:20.520
I dug this hole.

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:23.930
If I remember that, I won't be scared.

00:15:23.930 --> 00:15:26.730
Even if I can't see...

00:15:27.850 --> 00:15:29.280
I can't see anything.

00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:32.110
Not even through my Prophecy of Despair.

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:36.700
Why did I see that?

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:43.960
If Mikono really is the reincarnation of Silvie,

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:47.670
then she's not going to choose you, Amata.

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:51.050
I wasn't chosen.

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:56.600
She left me behind, and I wanted to die.

00:15:58.130 --> 00:16:01.360
I think I want to die.

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:03.920
If Jin's not in this world anymore...

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:08.080
then I don't want to be in it, either!

00:16:11.270 --> 00:16:12.070
Yunoha!

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:16.360
Yunoha's aura is vanishing!

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:23.460
Amata's power of flight.

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:25.540
Zessica's power of distortion.

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:29.900
Shrade's sound. Cayenne's despair.

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:33.220
And Yunoha's power of erasure.

00:16:35.390 --> 00:16:37.960
Their thoughts are going out of control.

00:16:37.960 --> 00:16:39.140
If it continues...

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:41.810
No! Yunoha!

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:43.960
Don't do it, Mikono!

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:47.440
We finally became friends!

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:49.940
We finally connected!

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:52.220
So why?

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:57.240
Come back! Please!

00:16:59.810 --> 00:17:00.660
I can't.

00:17:02.520 --> 00:17:04.040
Amata?

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:08.980
If I'm born again, I'll be abandoned again.

00:17:15.250 --> 00:17:18.860
I don't want to be abandoned by anyone ever again.

00:17:19.650 --> 00:17:24.730
Amata... Amata is going to be abandoned...

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:30.100
I've had enough. I don't want to live anymore.

00:17:30.630 --> 00:17:32.020
I want to stay here.

00:17:32.670 --> 00:17:36.240
I want to stay here with Jin.

00:17:38.470 --> 00:17:40.200
I don't want to be born again.

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:42.000
Never again.

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:45.080
Being alive and alone is...

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:46.620
It hurts...

00:17:47.610 --> 00:17:49.130
...to live.

00:17:49.530 --> 00:17:52.180
No! Stop!

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:55.220
You're all being stupid!

00:17:58.770 --> 00:18:00.660
What just happened?

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:04.200
Mikono Suzushiro, this is your power.

00:18:06.010 --> 00:18:09.940
The ending of life isn't the only death humans experience.

00:18:10.670 --> 00:18:14.110
Just like how we shed hair and lose teeth,

00:18:14.550 --> 00:18:17.880
the cells in our body, heart, and soul are always dying.

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:20.990
Moment by moment by moment.

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:23.990
Moment by moment?

00:18:25.150 --> 00:18:30.210
But if we are bound to our old, dead selves, and try we keep them with us,

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:36.460
we are divided and cut off from the universe.

00:18:37.220 --> 00:18:44.470
Mikono Suzushiro, your power is to connect those who are divided once more.

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:47.040
My power is to connect?

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:50.820
Yes. To reach out to those who are attached to their old selves

00:18:50.820 --> 00:18:54.640
and transform their dead into nourishment.

00:18:54.640 --> 00:18:57.120
Like the tendrils of a mushroom,

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:01.410
hidden within the earth.

00:19:01.970 --> 00:19:09.300
You connect all the fragmented souls together as they dangle between life and death.

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:17.420
All this time, these twelve thousand years, I've loved you.

00:19:18.390 --> 00:19:19.280
No way!

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:24.640
Eight thousand years from the time that I met you, my love will be stronger than ever before.

00:19:25.490 --> 00:19:27.020
That voice!

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:30.080
I was always alone.

00:19:31.450 --> 00:19:33.920
I didn't care about anyone else.

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:35.540
Jin, it's you!

00:19:36.130 --> 00:19:39.620
Yunoha, when I met you,

00:19:40.310 --> 00:19:45.480
for the first time in my life, I wanted to connect with someone.

00:19:46.850 --> 00:19:50.920
So please, don't stop living.

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:51.920
Yunoha...

00:19:52.910 --> 00:19:54.290
And the rest of you, too.

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:56.590
The rest of us?

00:19:57.870 --> 00:20:00.120
I realized that I'm not alone.

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:03.320
Our lives...

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:07.350
aren't just our own.

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:09.350
Our lives...

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:14.860
aren't just our own...

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:16.110
He's right!

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:21.580
Our lives can go beyond life and death...

00:20:21.580 --> 00:20:23.860
and connect!

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:28.990
The earth is so warm!

00:20:29.350 --> 00:20:32.000
We're being cradled by the dead!

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:37.790
I feel like I'm a baby being held at my mom's breast again!

00:20:38.350 --> 00:20:43.470
If I'd never been born, I wouldn't be here to experience this!

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:49.220
If I'd never been born, I wouldn't have met anyone here. I wouldn't have met Jin.

00:20:49.910 --> 00:20:53.730
There's nothing scary outside of this hole!

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:56.730
There'll be danger, all right.

00:20:56.730 --> 00:21:01.150
But there'll be the same warmth I feel in this hole!

00:21:01.810 --> 00:21:06.540
That warmth will always come with pain and suffering.

00:21:06.540 --> 00:21:07.910
But I still...

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:12.450
There are sounds that must be played from the edge of death and rebirth!

00:21:14.690 --> 00:21:15.880
Exactly!

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:18.380
Don't be scared!

00:21:18.950 --> 00:21:21.540
I'll be here, waiting for you!

00:21:23.030 --> 00:21:26.570
All of you are going to be born again!

00:21:26.570 --> 00:21:29.140
And I'll be waiting for you!

00:21:32.230 --> 00:21:39.150
As time flows on, we are all being born and reborn moment by moment.

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:42.150
The instant that nothing becomes something...

00:21:42.470 --> 00:21:44.780
is now!

00:21:45.170 --> 00:21:46.280
Now?

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:49.280
And when a heart is there to experience this very instant...

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:03.960
That is when thoughts are truly in Union.

00:22:10.850 --> 00:22:12.590
What happened?

00:22:12.590 --> 00:22:13.430
Mikono?

00:22:16.090 --> 00:22:17.700
Happy birthday!

00:22:35.190 --> 00:22:36.200
No way!

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:13.890
Being reborn from the earth gave those kids quite a power up.

00:24:14.410 --> 00:24:16.280
I'd better step up my game!

00:24:16.280 --> 00:24:19.970
Looks like my old taser is due for an upgrade!

00:24:20.490 --> 00:24:23.920
Next time on Aquarion Evol: The Beasts of Love.
